Summary/Information:
Birdwood Business Energy Pty Ltd (Birdwood) partnered with the Australian National University (ANU), the Energy Efficiency Council (EEC) and delivery partners to deliver a Flexibility Report Card Platform (FRCP) that informs commercial and industrial (C&amp;I) businesses of potential flexible load opportunities within their sites (the Project).  
During the Project’s life, falling battery costs and new subsidies meant battery storage became the preferred pathway for SME flexibility, overtaking standalone flexible load assessment.as proposed through the FRCP. This led to Mutual Termination of the Project.
